# Ouroboroid is cast in the second main phase of turn 1 (no counters yet, so it is a 1/3). At the beginning of combat on turn 3 its
# trigger goes on the stack and Bot2 answers with Lightning Bolt, killing it. The ability still resolves and X is the power it had
# on the battlefield, 1 (last-known information, CR 608.2h): the Ornithopter gets one counter, and the dead Ouroboroid none.

